<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS COLLATED MEDAL WINNERS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS COLLATED MEDAL WINNERS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
